    "status": "present",
    "value": "Delete the specified tree-node values and return the remaining component roots as a fresh forest; input links stay unchanged. The approach is: clone, detach deleted nodes and collect surviving nodes whose parent was deleted. Its target cost is O(n+d) time/O(n+d) space; fresh disjoint forest. Treat the invariant underlying that approach as the reason each local update preserves the required result. Check it against an independent bounded reference before relying on large-domain constructions."
  },
